# Garruk, Curse Breaker's -4: "Until your next turn, whenever one or more creatures attack one of your opponents, those
# creatures get +2/+2 and gain trample until end of turn." Bot1 casts Garruk, an Elvish Mystic and an Ornithopter (0/2 flier) on turn 1. On turn 3 it uses
# the -4 and attacks Bot2 with both: one batched trigger (Stack.Count = 1); the Mystic is a 3/3 and the Ornithopter a 2/4, so Bot2 takes 5 (15).
# On turn 4 Bot2's own Mystic attacks Bot1, who is not Garruk's controller's opponent: no bonus, Bot1 takes 1 (19). On turn 5
# Garruk's controller's next turn has begun, so the ability is gone and the Mystic deals only 1 and the Ornithopter nothing (Bot2 at 14).

